    },
    {
      "text": "A peculiar stone that can make certain species of\nPokémon evolve. It has a distinct thunderbolt pattern.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ある　特定の　ポケモンを\n進化させる　不思議な　石。\n稲妻の　模様が　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能让某些特定宝可梦\n进化的神奇石头。\n有着闪电般的花纹。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curiosa piedra que hace evolucionar a determinadas\nespecies de Pokémon. Tiene grabado un rayo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
